  "details": "# Problem\n\nAfter minimizing the navigation panel on the left in any of the My Worlds tabs (e.g. uploaded), the grid of worlds doesn't update to fit more tiles, leaving a big empty space on the right.\n\n[Screenshot #1]\n\n# Expected behavior\n\nWith the navigation panel minimized there should now be 5 columns of worlds in the grid, just like in any of the Featured Worlds tabs (e.g. Trending), no empty space left.\n\n[Screenshot #2]",
